# REFERENCE — rob (human) SECURED e1-baron, wave 30, 585 gold (2026-08-12)
The buffed Baron IS beatable (a human did it; "quite hard though"). His actual play — every input he made — is the tape `rob-baron-reference-w30-tape.json` in your arena. **Study it yourself: parse the entries, see what he did, and work out WHY it beat a 53k-HP boss.** That is the point — learn from the demonstration, don't wait to be told. The game's mechanics are in the source you're standing in (`src/`) — read them. Then find your own way through.

